  "ingredients": [
    "1 (14 ounce) package seasoned dry stuffing mix",
    "1 teaspoon ground sage",
    "1 cup chopped celery",
    "0.5 cup chicken broth",
    "1 (10.75 ounce) can condensed cream of celery soup",
    "1 (10.75 ounce) can condensed cream of chicken soup",
    "1 (10.5 ounce) can water",
    "2 boneless, skinless turkey breasts - cooked and shredded",
    "0.25 cup melted butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9x13-inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/1X1tv5VgakmgwQxapuQX1yQtnjU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18864-turkey-and-stuffing-casserole-VAT-step-01-f72792f3b90c4517ae60d7f9088c6e64.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18864/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine stuffing mix, sage, celery, and chicken broth in a large bowl until evenly moistened; set aside. Stir condensed cream of celery soup with ½ can water in a small bowl until smooth; set aside. Repeat with condensed cream of chicken soup in a separate bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QyS1Mggf0FHj6LnxmRN1PVUEp6I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18864-turkey-and-stuffing-casserole-VAT-step-02-c38e583c9621437ebcf75a1fadc6e025.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18864/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle 1/3 of the stuffing mixture evenly in the prepared baking dish. Layer 1/2 of the shredded turkey on top and pour the celery soup mixture over the turkey until evenly coated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XEKdvevL9LHVG9qKJMIyXs6ERFs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18864-turkey-and-stuffing-casserole-VAT-step-03-b1664cbc8ec54cb7b0e720ac1b89c558.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18864/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Top with another 1/3 of stuffing mixture, followed by the remaining turkey. Pour chicken soup mixture over turkey until covered, then sprinkle the remaining stuffing on top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Ojv2tk_dLk_HPhysP6vI1cXYRWc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18864-turkey-and-stuffing-casserole-VAT-step-04-a047f4cc01814b60ae5f0097ad6dbdfb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18864/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drizzle melted butter evenly over the casserole and press the mixture firmly with a spatula until compact.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xxYiGXrWMtz4DW_soqXjeYVqdoY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18864-turkey-and-stuffing-casserole-VAT-step-05-a6156162590f485480f0711fcb03367e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18864/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until hot and lightly browned on top, 25 to 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6_1PTNDWi32vnGwEIjdvzGtHjG4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/18864-turkey-and-stuffing-casserole-VAT-step-06-041c16fe541942ed895c02c34728b991.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/18864/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
